#: ../../source/models/model_abilities/rerank.rst:119
msgid ""
"The model virtualenv settings pin the validated backend versions: "
"``sentence-transformers[image]==6.1.0`` with ``transformers==5.20.0`` for"
" Sentence Transformers, ``transformers==5.20.0`` for native Transformers,"
" and ``vllm==0.32.0`` with ``transformers==5.19.0`` for vLLM. Use "
"separate virtual environments for these backends. Model virtualenv "
"settings install their respective dependencies automatically."
msgstr ""
"Le impostazioni degli ambienti virtuali del modello fissano le versioni "
"verificate dei backend. Per Sentence Transformers si usano ``sentence-"
"transformers[image]==6.1.0`` e ``transformers==5.20.0``, per il backend "
"Transformers nativo si usa ``transformers==5.20.0`` e per vLLM si usano "
"``vllm==0.32.0`` e ``transformers==5.19.0``. Usa un ambiente virtuale "
"distinto per ogni backend. Le impostazioni degli ambienti virtuali del "
"modello consentono di installare automaticamente le relative dipendenze."

#: ../../source/models/model_abilities/rerank.rst:126
msgid ""
"Hugging Face uses ``nvidia/Nemotron-3.5-Rerank-8B-BF16`` at revision "
"``main``; ModelScope uses ``nv-community/Nemotron-3.5-Rerank-8B-BF16`` at"
" revision ``master``. Select the download hub with ``--download_hub "
"huggingface`` or ``--download_hub modelscope`` when launching."
msgstr ""
"Hugging Face usa ``nvidia/Nemotron-3.5-Rerank-8B-BF16`` alla revisione "
"``main``. ModelScope usa ``nv-community/Nemotron-3.5-Rerank-8B-BF16`` "
"alla revisione ``master``. All’avvio seleziona la fonte di download con "
"``--download_hub huggingface`` o ``--download_hub modelscope``."

